class: negative
summary: a utf8 index decodes a codepoint value, which is not a place even through a mutable binding
constructs: 0060, 0600, 0610, 1050, 1900
program: program.ldn
codes: L0303
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, macos-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64
expect: expected.txt
args: ../tests/fixtures/negative/utf8-index-result-is-not-a-place/program.ldn
status: 1
